thored-checkbox-v1/III/true"] [:db/add "field:q-103442/authored-checkbox-v1/III" :answer-field/correct "answer:q-103442/authored-checkbox-v1/III/false"] [:db/ensure "field:q-103442/authored-checkbox-v1/III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186238008 :question/answer-fields "field:q-103442/authored-checkbox-v1/III"] [:db/retract 17592186238008 :question/answer-fields 17592186237713] [:db/cas 17592186238008 :question/problem "![](images/7d/7dc7480c7ee27073ff7be7475161742e317b30bf0c3e35af33dc93a772e6034a.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true with respect to the function $y=f(x)$ plotted above?\n\n- $f(x)$ has a critical point at $x=-1$\n- $f(x)$ has a stationary point at $x=1$\n- $f(x)$ has a local maximum at $x=3$" "![](images/7d/7dc7480c7ee27073ff7be7475161742e317b30bf0c3e35af33dc93a772e6034a.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true with respect to the function $y=f(x)$ plotted above?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/cas 17592186238008 :question/worked-solution "Let's check our statements.\n\n- Statement I is true. The function has a critical point (a corner) at $x=-1.$ In this case,  ${f}^{′}(-1)$ does not exist.\n\n- Statement II is false. The function has a critical point (a corner) at $x=1.$ In this case,  ${f}^{′}(-1)$ does not exist.\n\n- Statement III is false. The function has a local minimum at $x=3$ since $f(3)\\le f(x)$ for all $x$ close enough to $x=3.$\n\nTherefore, statement I is true, while statements II and III are false." "Let's check our statements.\n\n- The statement “$f(x)$ has a critical point at $x=-1$” is true. The function has a critical point (a corner) at $x=-1.$ In this case,  ${f}^{′}(-1)$ does not exist.\n\n- The statement “$f(x)$ has a stationary point at $x=1$” is false. The function has a critical point (a corner) at $x=1.$ In this case,  ${f}^{′}(-1)$ does not exist.\n\n- The statement “$f(x)$ has a local maximum at $x=3$” is false. The function has a local minimum at $x=3$ since $f(3)\\le f(x)$ for all $x$ close enough to $x=3.$\n\nTherefore, select only “$f(x)$ has a critical point at $x=-1$.”"] [:db/ensure 17592186238008 :question/validate] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false" :answer/id #uuid "652e1d3c-ce79-571d-becc-9c00c37f4c74"] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false" :answer/validate] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/true" :answer/id #uuid "8d872554-97ae-54c1-9f4e-c7d750586d30"] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/true" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/true" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/true" :answer/validate] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7e826697-d1ad-5455-bf98-b59520e6b053"] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/key "$x=1$"] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/choices "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false"] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/choices "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/true"] [:db/add "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/correct "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1/false"] [:db/ensure "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186329838 :question/answer-fields "field:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=1"] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=2/false" :answer/id #uuid "24e40deb-9f16-52bc-a416-a84ae7f57aea"] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=2/false" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "answer:q-47911/authored-checkbox-v1/x=2/false" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "answer:q-47911/authored-checkb